# ACME Logistics Dashboard

We built a web dashboard that reduced ACME's average incident response time by **40%**.

## Stack

- Astro + Solid (frontend)
- Cloudflare Workers + D1 (backend)
- Mapbox GL for mapping

## Results

- 320+ vehicles tracked simultaneously
- Average latency under 200ms
- Gradual rollout across 6 states
